  "summary": {
    "zh": "这是一款儿童大型堡垒拼搭套装，采用PP结构件，适用于家庭互动、课堂活动和创意搭建场景。\n\n品牌为尧顺，产地中国东莞，支持跨境供货，适合围绕帐篷与房屋主题进行组合搭建。",
    "en": "This is a large fort construction set for children, built with PP structural parts and suitable for family interaction, classroom activities, and creative building scenarios.\n\nBrand: Yaoshun. Origin: Dongguan, China. It supports cross-border supply and is suitable for tent- and house-themed modular construction."
  },
  "description": {
    "zh": [
      "该款Fort Building Kit大型堡垒拼搭套装采用拼插结构设计，可围绕帐篷、房屋和互动空间进行多形态组合，适合持续创意构建。",
      "产品适用于亲子互动、课程教具和活动空间布置，支持多次拆装与重复使用，可用于空间认知和协作训练场景。",
      "包装为彩盒，规格2M，单套重量参数明确，便于渠道上架、仓配管理和项目采购。"
    ],
    "en": [
      "This Fort Building Kit large construction set uses an interlocking structure and supports multiple layouts around tents, houses, and interactive spaces for continuous creative play.",
      "It is suitable for parent-child interaction, educational props, and event-space setup, with repeatable assembly for spatial learning and collaborative activities.",
      "The set uses color-box packaging with a 2M specification and clear unit-weight data, making it suitable for channel listing, warehouse operations, and project procurement."
    ]
  },
